Subject: [PATCH 1429/1463] =?UTF-8?q?HERESY=201490:=20the=20IRA=20merge=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?in=20the=20studio;=20backbones=20by=20their=20files'=20names=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?(=C2=ABYuE2=20BF16=C2=BB,=20=C2=ABYuE2=20IRA=20Q8=5F0=C2=BB)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Engine › Models and LoRAs › More models fetches the IRA merge (YuE2-3B with Mothersuperior's Instrumental and Real Audio v9 folded in) as BF16, Q8_0 or Q6_K from goldhub/YuE2-3B-Ruach_Studio-IRA-Merge at its pin (fetch-heresy.sh --ira). start.sh offers every backbone in models/ by its file's name, m-a-p's own first, then any merge (models/YuE2-3B-<merge>-<quant>.gguf as <merge>-<quant>), so a choice kept in settings.json starts again as itself. The bar's list and Compute's say «YuE2 BF16 · 7.2 GB», «YuE2 IRA Q8_0 · 3.8 GB», with what each is.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
